-We found the murder knife, Chief.

241
00:17:20,080 --> 00:17:21,206
What is this?

242
00:17:21,290 --> 00:17:25,252
It doesn't even cut.
It's like it came straight out of a movie.

243
00:17:25,335 --> 00:17:26,795
You're right! These are props too.

244
00:17:26,879 --> 00:17:30,632
It's coming back to me!
When that ghost killed me…

245
00:17:34,845 --> 00:17:37,431
-Ah-ha! I get it now!
-Well, hallelujah.

246
00:17:37,514 --> 00:17:40,309
That ghost was just pretending-- it was
some kind of horror movie roleplay!

247
00:17:40,392 --> 00:17:44,062
Which means the real blonde-bitch killer
is still out there.

248
00:17:44,146 --> 00:17:46,815
You're saying the Ghost
is unrelated to the serial killings?

249
00:17:46,899 --> 00:17:48,984
Wait… what if the real culprit
is using the ghost as a decoy

250
00:17:49,067 --> 00:17:50,360
to throw off the investigation?

251
00:17:50,444 --> 00:17:52,237
Is he always like this?

252
00:17:52,321 --> 00:17:55,032
-He watches too many horror movies.
-Where have I seen it before…

253
00:17:55,115 --> 00:17:56,617
Horror movie? That's it!

254
00:17:56,700 --> 00:18:00,496
Where's my phone?
Yes, that's where I've seen the Ghost!

255
00:18:00,579 --> 00:18:02,247
Panty! Look it up for me.

256
00:18:02,331 --> 00:18:03,415
Huh? Hell no.

257
00:18:03,499 --> 00:18:07,544
It's an old film.
It's called, "<i>Bitch Serial Killer</i>."

258
00:18:13,884 --> 00:18:16,804
It's just your run-of-the-mill
B-grade horror movie,

259
00:18:16,887 --> 00:18:21,350
but it became somewhat of a cult classic
that us horror nerds made memes about.

260
00:18:21,433 --> 00:18:22,601
Stop it there!

261
00:18:22,684 --> 00:18:25,437
<i>There's something cowering at the edge.</i>

262
00:18:25,521 --> 00:18:27,648
<i>Hey, isn't that the Ghost?</i>

263
00:18:27,731 --> 00:18:30,567
We all thought it was a real
paranormal footage…

264
00:18:30,651 --> 00:18:32,861
but I guess it was just a regular Ghost.

265
00:18:32,945 --> 00:18:34,863
And look who else is in this scene.

266
00:18:34,947 --> 00:18:37,866
A familiar face…

267
00:18:37,950 --> 00:18:39,201
Where is she now?

268
00:18:44,706 --> 00:18:46,834
Well, look what the cat dragged in.

269
00:18:46,917 --> 00:18:49,336
I trust you got in a real kill this time?

270
00:18:50,879 --> 00:18:52,297
What's this?

271
00:18:52,381 --> 00:18:54,758
Maggots and fake blood?

272
00:18:54,842 --> 00:18:57,135
Can't you do any better
than cheesy B-grade horror shit?

273
00:18:57,219 --> 00:19:00,764
To think you managed
to crawl your way out of my womb.

274
00:19:01,890 --> 00:19:03,225
You leave me with no choice.

275
00:19:03,308 --> 00:19:06,395
This one's real, honey.
Ain't no bluffing with props anymore.

276
00:19:06,478 --> 00:19:10,607
Don't worry.
Mommy will show you a real killer.

277
00:19:12,067 --> 00:19:13,277
This ends now!

278
00:19:15,028 --> 00:19:16,989
So you figured it out.

279
00:19:17,072 --> 00:19:21,410
See this here?
It keeps tabs on Panty at all times.

280
00:19:21,493 --> 00:19:25,372
And that means Panty
knows my location at all times!

281
00:19:26,582 --> 00:19:28,375
It was you all along, wasn't it?

282
00:19:28,458 --> 00:19:32,212
-You were our queen of B-grade horror.
-You really are a stalker.

283
00:19:32,296 --> 00:19:34,715
-Now you're a serial killer.
-Hey, creep. You listening?

284
00:19:34,798 --> 00:19:37,926
-Mob Bitch NPC. It's you!
-Hey, stalker. Hey, douche rag.

285
00:19:38,010 --> 00:19:42,514
That's right!
I am the legendary Blonde Bitch Queen.

286
00:19:42,598 --> 00:19:44,308
Mob Bitch NPC!

287
00:19:45,851 --> 00:19:48,020
Well, look at you in your heyday.

288
00:19:48,103 --> 00:19:52,274
She's the legendary horror starlet,
the Blond-Bitch-Killed-In-The-First-Act.

289
00:19:52,357 --> 00:19:54,818
Ever since that random appearance
in a B-grade horror flick,

290
00:19:54,902 --> 00:19:58,155
my only other options
dwindled to other B-grade horrors.

291
00:19:58,238 --> 00:20:01,450
And the final kicker? I got pigeonholed
into only playing the Blonde Bitch role.

292
00:20:01,533 --> 00:20:04,286
My acting career was over.

293
00:20:04,369 --> 00:20:05,454
But then he was born!

294
00:20:05,537 --> 00:20:09,416
A Ghost born out of my pure hatred
toward B-grade horror films.

295
00:20:09,499 --> 00:20:11,543
But can you believe my luck?
He's a complete nitwit.

296
00:20:11,627 --> 00:20:15,505
A B-grade Ghost born
from my hatred toward B-grade horror?

297
00:20:15,589 --> 00:20:18,050
How utterly cheesy!
The gods must be laughing.

298
00:20:18,133 --> 00:20:21,678
-B-grade horror is so--
-What's wrong with a little cheese?

299
00:20:21,762 --> 00:20:24,848
Sure, B-grades can be lame.
They can have cheap props.

300
00:20:24,932 --> 00:20:29,186
But in the moment, they seem real,
or better yet, even better than real!

301
00:20:29,853 --> 00:20:33,106
You must have experienced
the magic at some point, right?

302
00:20:33,190 --> 00:20:35,484
So why become a real murderer?

303
00:20:35,567 --> 00:20:36,818
You wanna know why?

304
00:20:36,902 --> 00:20:38,946
My back cracked
from carrying all those dead weights.

305
00:20:39,029 --> 00:20:40,948
Fuck those end-stage girls.

306
00:20:41,031 --> 00:20:43,158
I walk my own path.
Now I'm the main character.

307
00:20:43,241 --> 00:20:45,786
Now I am the serial killer!

308
00:20:45,869 --> 00:20:47,704
But why only target blonde bitches?

309
00:20:47,788 --> 00:20:50,958
Serial killers always
go for the blonde bitches first.

310
00:20:51,041 --> 00:20:52,709
That's the first premise of horror films.

311
00:20:52,793 --> 00:20:54,836
-She's crazy.
-Grandma, I expected better from you!

312
00:20:54,920 --> 00:20:56,838
Shut your pie hole, angel bitch.

313
00:20:56,922 --> 00:21:01,426
Well, if it isn't shit-for-brains.
You finally ready to bring your A-game?

314
00:21:01,510 --> 00:21:02,970
Then fuck these guys u--

315
00:21:06,473 --> 00:21:07,474
<i>Bitch.</i>

316
00:21:18,068 --> 00:21:19,361
Hey, Geek Boy.

317
00:21:27,327 --> 00:21:30,288
I see…
So this really made you happy, huh?

318
00:21:32,374 --> 00:21:34,626
<i>And thus, the case was closed.</i>

319
00:21:38,714 --> 00:21:41,591
<i>She's the Final Girl of this story.</i>

320
00:21:41,675 --> 00:21:43,343
This'll be hell to clean.

321
00:21:43,427 --> 00:21:46,054
<i>The monster became the hero,</i>

322
00:21:46,138 --> 00:21:51,268
<i>while the former heroine of horror fell</i>
<i>from grace and became a monster herself.</i>

323
00:21:51,351 --> 00:21:55,897
<i>Or perhaps it was us, the horror fans,</i>
<i>who propelled her descent into madness.</i>

324
00:21:56,523 --> 00:22:01,028
<i>Just who came up with the theory that the</i>
<i>blonde bitch is always the first to go?</i>

325
00:22:02,112 --> 00:22:05,115
<i>Just who is the real</i>
<i>monster in all of this?</i>

326
00:23:38,834 --> 00:23:40,836
Subtitle: Rychelle Brittain
